;; EXPECT: sort-error
;; MESSAGE: is ACI (set); multiplicities not allowed
;; An ACI operator stores a set, which holds each element once: a count there would be
;; discarded, so it is refused, in a ground term as in a pattern and a right-hand side.
(sort E)
(function a () E) (function b () E)
(function And (E) E :assoc-comm-idem)
(let t (And (a):5 (b)))
